  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile setting (config_005) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.650). This experiment tests adding image data (resnet50) to this strong baseline, using avgpool aggregation (proven effective in RNA-only) and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of multimodal inputs while building on a validated RNA encoder and aggregation method, balancing exploitation of current strengths with exploration of image data's potential."
